Test Case ID: TC-PWD-02
Test Component: Token Expiration & Reuse Prevention
Test Description: Verify that expired or already-used password reset tokens are strictly rejected by the backend validation logic.
Test Steps:
-Generate a password reset token and simulate a time lapse past the expiration threshold (or submit an expired token directly).
-Attempt to submit a new password using the expired token; verify that the system rejects the request with an expiration error.
-Successfully use a valid reset token once, then attempt to reuse the exact same token a second time.
-Verify that the system blocks reuse and flags the token as invalid.

Expected Result: The system enforces strict security boundaries by rejecting expired timestamps and preventing the reuse of consumed password reset tokens.
Status: PASS ✅